  "@type": "SoftwareSourceCode",
  "identifier": "lagprotest",
  "description": "Extends the Procrustean randomization test (PROTEST; Jackson (1995) <doi:10.1080/11956860.1995.11682297>; Peres-Neto and Jackson (2001) <doi:10.1007/s004420100720>) to ordered multivariate series. Concordance between two configurations is scanned across candidate temporal lags. Significance is assessed with phase-randomized surrogates (default), cyclic shifts of the full series or free permutation of rows, and a global max-statistic p-value accounts for scanning several lags and selecting the best one. Returns the lag profile, the lag of maximal concordance and per-observation Procrustes residuals.",
  "name": "lagprotest: Lagged Procrustean Randomization Test for Multivariate Time Series",
  "relatedLink": "https://provetelab.org/lagprotest/",
